# Screenshots that show a real position. `npm run screenshots` still produces these
# locally — they are useful while working on the map — but they must never be
# committed: the basemap names the streets around whoever ran the capture, the
# position dot sits on them, and the nearby list gives landmarks with exact
# distances. An earlier set was published to a public repo from a home address.
docs/screenshots/*-map.png
docs/screenshots/*-map-legend.png
docs/screenshots/*-list.png
docs/screenshots/*-pin-sheet.png
docs/screenshots/*-admin-activity.png
